ranslation">一往无前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">furikaerazu</span></p><p begin="19.623" end="26.140" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">進</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="19.623" end="20.360">す</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="20.360" end="20.740">す</span></span></span><span begin="20.740" end="21.200">み</span><span begin="21.200" end="21.660">ゆ</span><span begin="21.660" end="22.100">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">旅</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="22.100" end="22.580">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="22.580" end="23.040">び</span></span></span><span begin="23.040" end="23.480">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">宵</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="23.480" end="24.020">よ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="24.020" end="24.860">い</span></span></span><span begin="24.860" end="25.380">に</span><span begin="25.380" end="26.140">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">不停走在旅途的夜晚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">susumiyuku tabi no yoi ni wa</span></p><p begin="26.720" end="30.260" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">人</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="26.720" end="27.660">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="27.660" end="28.160">と</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">気</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="28.160" end="28.820">け</span></span></span><span begin="28.820" end="29.080">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">勿</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="29.080" end="29.520">な</span></span></span><span begin="29.540" end="30.260">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">周围空无一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hitoke mo naku</span></p><p begin="30.820" end="37.820" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">月</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="30.820" end="31.560">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="31.560" end="31.840">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">灯</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="31.840" end="32.240">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="32.240" end="32.740">か</span></span></span><span begin="32.740" end="33.200">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">只</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="33.200" end="33.660">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="33.660" end="34.060">だ</span></span></span><span begin="34.060" end="34.560">さ</span><span begin="34.560" end="35.040">ざ</span><span begin="35.040" end="36.420">め</span><span begin="36.420" end="37.820">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">明月也只是孤寂地叫嚣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tsukiakari tada sazameku</span></p><p begin="43.340" end="48.440" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">果</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="43.340" end="44.220">は</span></span></span><span begin="44.220" end="44.700">て</span><span begin="44.700" end="45.420">し</span><span begin="45.420" end="45.700">な</span><span begin="45.700" end="46.360">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">迷宮</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="46.360" end="48.440">mazea</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">似是身处无尽的迷宫</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hateshinaki meizu</span></p><p begin="48.860" end="53.740" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">儚</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="48.860" end="49.780">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="49.780" end="50.240">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="50.240" end="51.160">な</span></span></span><span begin="51.160" end="51.380">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">存</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="51.380" end="51.660">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="51.660" end="52.580">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">在</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="52.580" end="53.060">ざ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="53.060" end="53.740">い</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">周围都是虚幻的存在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hakanaki sonzai</span></p><p begin="54.400" end="1:00.580" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">土</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="54.400" end="55.340">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="55.340" end="55.820">ち</span></span></span><span begin="55.820" end="56.480">に</span><span begin="56.480" end="56.760">ま</span><span begin="56.760" end="57.180">み</span><span begin="57.180" end="58.120">れ</span><span begin="58.120" end="58.560">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="58.560" end="59.460">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="59.460" end="59.920">る</span></span></span><span begin="59.920" end="1:00.580">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">风尘仆仆地前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tsuchi ni mamirete aruku</span></p><p begin="1:01.340" end="1:10.030" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">胸</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:01.340" end="1:01.840">む</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:01.840" end="1:02.300">ね</span></span></span><span begin="1:02.300" end="1:02.760">に</span><span begin="1:02.760" end="1:03.520">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:03.840" end="1:04.120">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:04.120" end="1:04.820">め</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:04.820" end="1:05.060">み</span></span></span><span begin="1:05.060" end="1:05.403">る</span><span begin="1:05.403" end="1:06.303">as</span><span begin="1:06.303" end="1:06.883">pho</span><span begin="1:06.883" end="1:10.030">delus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">心中是梦想的水仙花</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mune ni wa yumemiru asphodelus</span></p><p begin="1:10.560" end="1:15.720" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">誰</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:10.560" end="1:10.840">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:10.840" end="1:11.060">れ</span></span></span><span begin="1:11.060" end="1:11.480">の</span><span begin="1:11.480" end="1:11.720">た</span><span begin="1:11.720" end="1:11.920">め</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.920" end="1:12.180">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:12.180" end="1:12.420">ん</span></span></span><span begin="1:12.420" end="1:12.840">の</span><span begin="1:12.840" end="1:13.080">た</span><span begin="1:13.080" end="1:13.320">め</span><span begin="1:13.320" end="1:13.560">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歴</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.560" end="1:13.760">れ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.760" end="1:14.240">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">史</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:14.240" end="1:14.500">し</span></span></span><span begin="1:14.500" end="1:14.720">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">刻</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:14.720" end="1:14.940">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:14.940" end="1:15.220">ざ</span></span></span><span begin="1:15.220" end="1:15.720">む</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这历史是为了谁为了什么而铭刻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dare no tame nan no tame ni rekishi wa kizamu</span></p><p begin="1:16.060" end="1:20.900" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:16.060" end="1:16.580">う</span></span></span><span begin="1:16.580" end="1:17.020">ま</span><span begin="1:17.020" end="1:17.300">れ</span><span begin="1:17.300" end="1:17.520">ゆ</span><span begin="1:17.520" end="1:17.960">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">悲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:17.960" end="1:18.460">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:18.460" end="1:18.840">な</span></span></span><span begin="1:18.840" end="1:19.340">し</span><span begin="1:19.340" end="1:19.560">み</span><span begin="1:19.560" end="1:20.900">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">悲伤渐生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">umareyuku kanashimi o</span></p><p begin="1:21.620" end="1:25.200" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.620" end="1:21.880">い</span><span begin="1:21.880" end="1:22.080">と</span><span begin="1:22.080" end="1:22.580">し</span><span begin="1:22.580" end="1:22.820">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">者</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:22.820" end="1:23.060">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:23.060" end="1:23.280">の</span></span></span><span begin="1:23.280" end="1:23.500">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">交</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:23.500" end="1:23.920">か</span></span></span><span begin="1:23.920" end="1:24.140">わ</span><span begin="1:24.140" end="1:24.380">す</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">誓</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:24.380" end="1:24.620">ち</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:24.620" end="1:24.880">か</span></span></span><span begin="1:24.880" end="1:25.200">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">与亲爱的人互换誓言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itoshiki mono to kawasu chikai</span></p><p begin="1:25.340" end="1:26.780" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">振</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:25.340" end="1:25.580">ふ</span></span></span><span begin="1:25.580" end="1:25.820">り</span><span begin="1:25.820" end="1:26.020">か</span><span begin="1:26.020" end="1:26.260">ざ</span><span begin="1:26.260" end="1:26.780">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">高举希望</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">furikazashi</span></p><p begin="1:27.140" end="1:29.963" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.140" end="1:27.400">未</span><span begin="1:27.400" end="1:27.640">来</span><span begin="1:27.640" end="1:28.100">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歌</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:28.140" end="1:28.580">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:28.580" end="1:29.040">た</span></span></span><span begin="1:29.040" end="1:29.460">え</span><span begin="1:29.460" end="1:29.963">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">歌唱未来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">asu o utae yo</span></p><p begin="1:29.963" end="1:32.710" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.963" end="1:30.413">Pa</span><span begin="1:30.413" end="1:32.710">bilio</span></p><p begin="1:51.180" end="1:54.700" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:51.180" end="1:52.060">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:52.060" end="1:52.560">き</span></span></span><span begin="1:52.560" end="1:53.240">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">待</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:53.240" end="1:53.480">ま</span></span></span><span begin="1:53.480" end="1:53.920">た</span><span begin="1:53.920" end="1:54.700">ず</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">时不我待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">toki o matazu</span></p><p begin="1:55.320" end="2:01.680" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">朽</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:55.320" end="1:55.980">く</span></span></span><span begin="1:55.980" end="1:56.220">ち</span><span begin="1:56.240" end="1:56.720">て</span><span begin="1:56.720" end="1:57.200">ゆ</span><span begin="1:57.200" end="1:57.640">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">追</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:57.640" end="1:58.140">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:58.140" end="1:58.540">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">憶</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:58.540" end="1:59.020">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:59.020" end="1:59.500">く</span></span></span><span begin="1:59.500" end="2:00.413">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">実</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:00.413" end="2:00.803">み</span></span></span><span begin="2:00.803" end="2:01.680">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">将那渐趋腐朽的追忆之果实</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kuchiteyuku tsuioku no mi o</span></p><p begin="2:02.220" end="2:06.120" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">拾</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:02.220" end="2:03.180">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.180" end="2:03.700">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="2:03.700" end="2:04.320">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">上</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:04.320" end="2:04.580">あ</span></span></span><span begin="2:04.580" end="2:05.000">げ</span><span begin="2:05.000" end="2:05.383">ま</span><span begin="2:05.383" end="2:05.760">しょ</span><span begin="2:05.760" end="2:06.120">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">捡起来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hiroiagemashō</span></p><p begin="2:06.440" end="2:13.520" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">離</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.440" end="2:07.060">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:07.060" end="2:07.340">な</span></span></span><span begin="2:07.340" end="2:07.760">れ</span><span begin="2:07.780" end="2:08.260">て</span><span begin="2:08.260" end="2:08.720">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">忘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:08.720" end="2:09.120">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.120" end="2:09.620">す</span></span></span><span begin="2:09.620" end="2:10.140">れ</span><span begin="2:10.140" end="2:10.560">ぬ</span><span begin="2:10.560" end="2:11.350">よ</span><span begin="2:11.350" end="2:11.960">う</span><span begin="2:11.960" end="2:13.520">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">愿即便分离也不会忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hanarete mo wasurenu yō ni</span></p><p begin="2:16.080" end="2:21.220" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">内</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.080" end="2:17.000">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:17.000" end="2:17.520">ち</span></span></span><span begin="2:17.520" end="2:18.160">な</span><span begin="2:18.160" end="2:18.500">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">草原</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.500" end="2:21.220">prairia</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">内心的草原</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">uchi naru pureria</span></p><p begin="2:21.600" end="2:26.540" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">罪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="te