"container"><span tts:ruby="base">握</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:38.700" end="3:38.983">に</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:38.983" end="3:39.200">ぎ</span></span></span><span begin="3:39.200" end="3:39.800">り</span><span begin="3:39.800" end="3:40.100">し</span><span begin="3:40.100" end="3:40.340">め</span><span begin="3:40.340" end="3:40.580">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">剣</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:40.580" end="3:40.800">け</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:40.800" end="3:41.060">ん</span></span></span><span begin="3:41.060" end="3:41.540">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">紧握的剑上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nigirishimeta ken ni</span></p><p begin="3:41.700" end="3:44.220" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:41.700" end="3:42.040">ひ</span><span begin="3:42.040" end="3:42.560">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">粒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:42.560" end="3:42.880">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:42.880" end="3:43.120">ぶ</span></span></span><span begin="3:43.120" end="3:43.340">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">涙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:43.340" end="3:43.580">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:43.580" end="3:43.800">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:43.800" end="3:44.220">だ</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">落下一滴泪水</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hitotsubu no namida</span></p><p begin="3:44.460" end="3:49.340" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">優</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:44.460" end="3:44.720">や</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:44.720" end="3:45.340">さ</span></span></span><span begin="3:45.340" end="3:45.620">し</span><span begin="3:45.620" end="3:45.900">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:45.900" end="3:46.140">よ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">明</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:46.140" end="3:46.540">あ</span></span></span><span begin="3:46.540" end="3:47.060">け</span><span begin="3:47.060" end="3:47.500">へ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">還</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:47.500" end="3:47.760">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:47.760" end="3:47.980">え</span></span></span><span begin="3:47.980" end="3:49.340">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">向着温柔的黎明回归</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yasashii yoake e kaeru</span></p><p begin="3:50.083" end="3:53.920" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:50.083" end="3:51.160">さぁ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">踊</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:51.160" end="3:51.640">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:51.640" end="3:52.340">ど</span></span></span><span begin="3:52.340" end="3:52.580">り</span><span begin="3:52.580" end="3:53.020">ま</span><span begin="3:53.020" end="3:53.470">しょ</span><span begin="3:53.470" end="3:53.920">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">来吧 舞动起来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sā odorimashō</span></p><p begin="3:54.380" end="4:00.800" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">神</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:54.380" end="3:55.120">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:55.120" end="3:55.360">み</span></span></span><span begin="3:55.360" end="3:55.823">の</span><span begin="3:55.823" end="3:56.740">黄</span><span begin="3:56.740" end="3:57.660">昏</span><span begin="3:57.660" end="3:58.080">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">杯</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:58.080" end="3:58.560">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:58.560" end="3:59.240">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:59.240" end="3:59.480">ず</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:59.480" end="3:59.960">き</span></span></span><span begin="3:59.960" end="4:00.800">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">将神圣的黄昏置于杯中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kami no tasogare o sakazuki ni</span></p><p begin="4:01.153" end="4:08.240" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:01.153" end="4:02.760">運</span><span begin="4:02.760" end="4:03.440">命</span><span begin="4:03.440" end="4:03.660">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">輪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:03.660" end="4:04.140">わ</span></span></span><span begin="4:04.140" end="4:05.100">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">弄</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:05.480" end="4:06.030">ろ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:06.030" end="4:06.320">う</span></span></span><span begin="4:06.320" end="4:06.860">さ</span><span begin="4:06.860" end="4:07.340">れ</span><span begin="4:07.360" end="4:07.800">て</span><span begin="4:07.800" end="4:08.240">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">即便被命运之轮所玩弄</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sadame no wa ni rōsarete mo</span></p><p begin="4:08.240" end="4:16.900" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:08.240" end="4:08.720">そ</span><span begin="4:08.720" end="4:09.180">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">命</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:09.180" end="4:09.700">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:09.700" end="4:10.780">の</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:10.780" end="4:11.020">ち</span></span></span><span begin="4:11.020" end="4:11.780">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">燃</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:12.140" end="4:12.460">も</span></span></span><span begin="4:12.460" end="4:12.960">や</span><span begin="4:12.960" end="4:13.780">し</span><span begin="4:13.780" end="4:16.900">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">也要燃烧这生命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sono inochi o moyashite</span></p><p begin="4:17.480" end="4:20.500" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:17.480" end="4:17.780">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:17.780" end="4:18.000">み</span></span></span><span begin="4:18.000" end="4:18.400">の</span><span begin="4:18.400" end="4:18.680">た</span><span begin="4:18.680" end="4:18.900">め</span><span begin="4:18.900" end="4:19.120">未</span><span begin="4:19.120" end="4:19.380">来</span><span begin="4:19.380" end="4:19.800">の</span><span begin="4:19.800" end="4:20.060">た</span><span begin="4:20.060" end="4:20.280">め</span><span begin="4:20.280" end="4:20.500">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">为了你 为了未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi no tame asu no tame ni</span></p><p begin="4:20.500" end="4:22.560" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:20.500" end="4:20.740">わ</span><span begin="4:20.740" end="4:21.160">た</span><span begin="4:21.160" end="4:21.420">し</span><span begin="4:21.420" end="4:21.640">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:21.640" end="4:21.900">い</span></span></span><span begin="4:21.900" end="4:22.140">き</span><span begin="4:22.140" end="4:22.560">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我要活下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">watashi wa ikiru</span></p><p begin="4:23.040" end="4:27.840" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">囚</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:23.040" end="4:23.280">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:23.280" end="4:23.500">ら</span></span></span><span begin="4:23.500" end="4:23.940">わ</span><span begin="4:23.940" end="4:24.180">れ</span><span begin="4:24.180" end="4:24.420">た</span><span begin="4:24.420" end="4:24.900">こ</span><span begin="4:24.900" end="4:25.340">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:25.340" end="4:25.820">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:25.820" end="4:26.240">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">地</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:26.240" end="4:26.520">ち</span></span></span><span begin="4:26.520" end="4:27.840">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在这被囚困的大地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">torawareta kono daichi de</span></p><p begin="4:28.470" end="4:32.260" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">純</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:28.470" end="4:28.833">ル</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:28.833" end="4:29.290">ビ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">色</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:29.290" end="4:29.500">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:29.500" end="4:29.740">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="4:29.740" end="4:29.960">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:29.960" end="4:30.200">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:30.200" end="4:30.420">ら</span></span></span><span begin="4:30.420" end="4:30.920">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">突</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:30.920" end="4:31.120">つ</span></span></span><span begin="4:31.120" end="4:31.360">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:31.360" end="4:31.580">ぬ</span></span></span><span begin="4:31.580" end="4:31.820">け</span><span begin="4:31.820" end="4:32.260">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">穿过纯色的天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">junshoku no sora o tsukinukete</span></p><p begin="4:32.260" end="4:33.680" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:32.260" end="4:32.520">何</span><span begin="4:32.520" end="4:32.740">処</span><span begin="4:32.740" end="4:32.960">ま</span><span begin="4:32.960" end="4:33.240">で</span><span begin="4:33.240" end="4:33.680">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">无论到何处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">doko made mo</span></p><p begin="4:34.120" end="4:36.920" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">可</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:34.120" end="4:34.420">か</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">憐</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:34.420" end="4:34.520">れ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:34.520" end="4:35.020">ん</span></span></span><span begin="4:35.020" end="4:35.520">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">舞</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:35.520" end="4:35.980">ま</span></span></span><span begin="4:35.980" end="4:36.400">え</span><span begin="4:36.400" end="4:36.920">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">都惹人怜爱地舞动吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">karen ni mae yo</span></p><p begin="4:36.920" end="4:38.960" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:36.920" end="4:37.373">Pa</span><span begin="4:37.373" end="4:38.960">bilio</span></p><p begin="4:39.643" end="4:41.650" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:39.643" end="4:40.143">Pa</span><span begin="4:40.143" end="4:41.650">bilio</span></p><p begin="4:42.403" end="4:45.700" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:42.403" end="4:42.903">Pa</span><span begin="4:42.903" end="4:45.700">bilio</span></p></div></body></tt>